  "verdict": {
    "decision": "RECRUIT WITH RESTRICTIONS",
    "capability_reproduced": true,
    "rationale": "The CorporateProbeSpecialist delivers a decisive capability advantage over Argus generalist search for structured corporate registry discovery (recall jumps from 26.7% to 100.0%, pass rate from 20.0% to 93.3%). However, standalone probing suffers critical failure modes: it conflates Registered Agents (e.g. Corporation Service Company) with officers/owners, fails to identify superseded 10-K filings overridden by amended 10-K/A restatements, and misinterprets historical resignations as active appointments (epistemic accuracy only 60.0%). Delegating through the Argus Verifier resolves all registered-agent confusions, correctly detects superseded filings, and elevates epistemic accuracy to 100.0%. Therefore, the specialist is recruited strictly under the Argus verification gate."
  }
